---
import LeafIcon from './LeafIcon.astro';
---
<div class="card mt-6 bg-butter/25">
  <h2 class="hand-title text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
    <LeafIcon size={18} class="text-mint animate-wiggle" />A note on returns
  </h2>
  <p class="text-coco-light mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed">
    The annual return you enter is a long-term <strong class="text-coco">planning assumption</strong> for diversified stock
    investments (like index funds) — a projection, not a guaranteed rate. For context: cash savings currently earn around 4%,
    while the stock market has averaged about 10% a year before inflation (roughly 7% after) over the past century.
    Actual returns vary year to year, and past performance never guarantees future results.
  </p>
</div>
